WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Turn off the monitors, let the tubes cool down

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.500
The morning light is creeping across the town

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.200
We spent a lifetime looking at the stars

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.800
Counting our blessings and healing our scars

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.500
From a basement room in eighty-six

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.200
To the final master of the analog mix

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.800
Every chord we struck, every breath we drew

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Was finding my way back home to you

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.200
The night is over, the calibration's done

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.500
We're orbiting the morning sun

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.800
We don't have to fade to black

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.800
We're never going back

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
We're going to fade to dawn!

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.200
When all the heavy shadows are gone!

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.500
Step out of the studio and into the light

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.500
Everything is going to be alright

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.800
Keep the tape rolling, let the music play on

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.500
As we fade to dawn!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:41.500
[Instrumental Interlude]

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.500
Four pairs of hands on the mixing board

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.200
Holding on to a single golden chord

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.800
The suits and the towers have crumbled to dust

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.500
Nothing remains but the love that we trust

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:05.200
Open the heavy soundproof door

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:09.800
Listen to the ocean on the Virginia shore

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.500
We built the engine, we lit the spark

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:19.500
Now we don't have to be afraid of the dark!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.000
We don't have to fade to black

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.000
We're never going back

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.200
We're going to fade to dawn!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.200
When all the heavy shadows are gone!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.500
Step out of the studio and into the light

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.500
Everything is going to be alright

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.800
Keep the tape rolling, let the music play on

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:46.500
As we fade to dawn!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.500
Let the synthesizers ring into the morning air

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:56.200
With the wind in our faces and the sun in our hair

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:01.000
Twenty-five years was just the overture

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:06.500
The signal is strong and the note is pure!

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Fade to dawn!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.500
Let the daylight in!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:20.000
Fade to dawn!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.200
Where the new days begin!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:28.500
Here comes the sun!

00:03:28.800 --> 00:04:22.000
[Guitar and Synthesizer Solo]

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.200
We don't have to fade to black

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:28.200
We're never going back

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.400
We're going to fade to dawn!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.500
When all the heavy shadows are gone!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.800
Step out of the studio and into the light

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.800
Everything is going to be alright

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.000
Keep the tape rolling, let the music play on

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.800
As we fade to dawn!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.500
Fade to dawn...

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.500
Into the morning light...

00:04:54.800 --> 00:05:00.500
The Stardust Engine is running...

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:14.500
[Outro]
